	quest.73C92D3D010CA831.quest_desc: [
		"L_Ender's Cataclysm adds huge bosses with their own dungeons. Every boss drops materials for great gear, and later bosses are tougher."
		""
		"§eHow it works:§r most bosses are found with special eyes. Throw the eye and it flies toward the boss's structure. Some structures, like the Sunken City, you have to explore to find. Suit up with a diamond sword at least."
		""
		"§eSuggested order:§r Ender Guardian, Netherite Monstrosity, Ignis, Ancient Remnant, the Harbinger, Maledictus, the Leviathan, then Scylla."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Diamond Sword and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.73C92D3D010CA831.title: "Big Bosses"
